<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cardiac Rehabilitation for CKD Patients After Acute MI – W. G. M. Rivero, MD</title>
<meta name="description" content="A structured cardiac rehabilitation guide for CKD and dialysis patients recovering from acute myocardial infarction — exercise phases, medications, diet, and monitoring.">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=DM+Sans:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{--navy:#0f1e2e;--gold:#b8962e;--gold-light:#d4af4f;--teal:#1a6b72;--teal-light:#e1f5f0;--text:#1a1a1a;--text-muted:#5a6472;--border:#e2e6eb;--bg:#f9fafb;--white:#ffffff;--red:#c0392b;--red-soft:#fdf0ef;--amber:#f5a623;--amber-soft:#fef9ec;--green:#2d7a4f;--green-soft:#edf7f2;--purple:#6c3d8e;--purple-soft:#f5edfb;}
  *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}
  body{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;color:var(--text);background:var(--white);line-height:1.7;font-size:16px;}
  .site-header{background:var(--navy);padding:0 32px;height:56px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:200;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);}
  .site-header a.brand{font-size:16px;font-weight:400;color:white;text-decoration:none;}
  .site-header a.brand strong{font-weight:600;color:#d4af4f;}
  .site-header a.back{font-size:12px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);text-decoration:none;}
  .hero{background:var(--navy);color:white;padding:72px 0 80px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
  .hero::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-60px;right:-80px;width:420px;height:420px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid rgba(184,150,46,.15);}
  .container{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
  .hero-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold-light);border:1px solid rgba(184,150,46,.4);padding:5px 14px;border-radius:20px;margin-bottom:24px;}
  .hero h1{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:clamp(28px,5vw,44px);font-weight:600;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px;}
  .hero-sub{font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);max-width:620px;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:32px;}
  .hero-meta{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.5);}
  .hero-meta strong{color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);}
  .nav-strip{background:var(--white);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);position:sticky;top:56px;z-index:100;}
  .nav-pills{display:flex;gap:4px;padding:12px 32px;max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-width:none;}
  .nav-pills::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none;}
  .nav-pill{white-space:nowrap;font-size:13px;font-weight:500;color:var(--text-muted);text-decoration:none;padding:6px 14px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid transparent;transition:all .2s;}
  .nav-pill:hover{color:var(--navy);border-color:var(--border);background:var(--bg);}
  .section{padding:60px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .section:last-of-type{border-bottom:none;}
  .section-tag{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);margin-bottom:10px;}
  .section h2{font-family:'Lora',serif;font-size:clamp(22px,3.5vw,30px);font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);line-height:1.3;margin-bottom:18px;}
  .section p{color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:14px;}
  .intro-callout{background:var(--navy);color:white;border-radius:16px;padding:28px 32px;margin-bottom:32px;}
  .intro-callout p{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);font-size:16px;line-height:1.75;margin:0;}
  .intro-callout p strong{color:white;}
  .two-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin:20px 0;}
  .three-col{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr));gap:14px;margin:20px 0;}
  @media(max-width:600px){.two-col,.three-col{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .feature-card{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:12px;padding:18px;}
  .feature-card h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
  .feature-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
  .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;flex-shrink:0;}
  .dot-teal{background:var(--teal);}.dot-red{background:var(--red);}.dot-amber{background:var(--amber);}.dot-green{background:var(--green);}.dot-navy{background:var(--navy);}.dot-purple{background:var(--purple);}
  .alert{border-radius:12px;padding:18px 22px;margin:20px 0;display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .alert-teal{background:var(--teal-light);border-left:3px solid var(--teal);}
  .alert-amber{background:var(--amber-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--amber);}
  .alert-green{background:var(--green-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--green);}
  .alert-red{background:var(--red-soft);border-left:3px solid var(--red);}
  .alert-icon{font-size:18px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:1px;}
  .alert-body h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:5px;}
  .alert-body p,.alert-body ul{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin:0;line-height:1.6;}
  .alert-body ul{margin:6px 0 0 16px;}
  .alert-body ul li{margin-bottom:4px;}
  .illus-wrap{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;margin:24px 0;text-align:center;}
  .illus-caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-top:10px;font-style:italic;}
  .phase-card{border-radius:14px;padding:24px;border:1px solid var(--border);margin-bottom:16px;}
  .phase1{border-left:4px solid var(--red);}
  .phase2{border-left:4px solid var(--amber);}
  .phase3{border-left:4px solid var(--teal);}
  .phase4{border-left:4px solid var(--green);}
  .phase-card .phase-label{font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;}
  .phase1 .phase-label{color:var(--red);}
  .phase2 .phase-label{color:#9a6500;}
  .phase3 .phase-label{color:var(--teal);}
  .phase4 .phase-label{color:var(--green);}
  .phase-card h4{font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:4px;}
  .phase-card .phase-when{font-size:12px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:12px;font-style:italic;}
  .phase-card p{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:8px;}
  .phase-card ul{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-left:16px;line-height:1.7;}
  .lab-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin:18px 0;font-size:14px;}
  .lab-table th{text-align:left;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--text-muted);padding:9px 13px;background:var(--bg);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .lab-table td{padding:11px 13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text-muted);vertical-align:top;}
  .lab-table td:first-child{font-weight:500;color:var(--navy);}
  .lab-table tr:last-child td{border-bottom:none;}
  .lab-table tr:hover td{background:var(--bg);}
  .stop-sign{background:var(--red-soft);border:2px solid var(--red);border-radius:12px;padding:20px 24px;margin:20px 0;}
  .stop-sign h4{font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red);margin-bottom:8px;}
  .stop-sign ul{font-size:14px;color:var(--text-muted);margin-left:16px;line-height:1.7;}
  .dr-card{background:var(--navy);color:white;border-radius:16px;padding:28px;display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:40px;}
  .dr-avatar{width:52px;height:52px;background:rgba(184,150,46,.25);border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:20px;flex-shrink:0;border:2px solid rgba(184,150,46,.4);}
  .dr-card h4{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;color:white;margin-bottom:4px;}
  .dr-card p{font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.65);line-height:1.6;}
  .dr-card .dr-creds{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.4);margin-top:6px;}
  .guide-footer{background:var(--bg);border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:36px 0;margin-top:56px;}
  .guide-footer .footer-inner{max-width:880px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;}
  .guide-footer p{font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);}
  .guide-footer a{color:var(--teal);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;}
  .disclaimer{background:var(--amber-soft);border:1px solid rgba(245,166,35,.25);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;margin:32px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.6;}
  .disclaimer strong{color:var(--navy);}
@media print{.site-header,.nav-strip,.guide-toggle-bar,.print-btn,.float-controls,.guide-footer{display:none!important;}body{font-size:13px;color:#000;background:#fff;}.hero{background:#fff!important;color:#000!important;padding:20px 0!important;}.hero h1{color:#0f1e2e!important;font-size:22px!important;}.container{padding:0 24px;}.section{padding:20px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd;}.intro-callout{background:#f0f4f8!important;color:#000!important;border:1px solid #ccc;}.intro-callout p{color:#222!important;}.illus-wrap{border:1px solid #ccc;page-break-inside:avoid;}.complication-card,.feature-card,.phase-card,.aki-stage,.cause-card{border:1px solid #ccc!important;background:#fff!important;page-break-inside:avoid;}.lab-table th{background:#eee!important;}.dr-card{background:#f0f4f8!important;color:#000!important;border:1px solid #ccc;}.dr-card h4,.dr-card p{color:#222!important;}.stop-sign{background:#fff0f0!important;border:1px solid #c00!important;}.disclaimer{background:#fff8e8!important;}@page{margin:18mm 15mm;size:A4;}}html[data-theme="dark"]{--navy:#0f1e2e;--gold:#b8962e;--gold-light:#d4af4f;--teal:#25949d;--teal-light:#0e2f32;--text:#e8eaf0;--text-muted:#8a95a8;--border:#2a3548;--bg:#141c2a;--white:#1a2030;--red:#e55;--red-soft:#2a1515;--amber:#f5a623;--amber-soft:#2a1f0a;--green:#3d9a6a;--green-soft:#0e2a1c;--purple:#9a6ed4;--purple-soft:#1a1030;}html[data-theme="dark"] body{background:#0f1520;color:#e8eaf0;}html[data-theme="dark"] .site-header{background:#080d16;}html[data-theme="dark"] .nav-strip{background:#141c2a;border-color:#2a3548;}html[data-theme="dark"] .hero{background:#080d16;}html[data-theme="dark"] .section{border-color:#2a3548;}html[data-theme="dark"] .intro-callout{background:#080d16;}html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .illus-wrap,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .complication-card,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .phase-card,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .aki-stage,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .cause-card{background:#1a2535;border-color:#2a3548;}html[data-theme="dark"] h2,
  html[data-theme="dark"] h3,
  html[data-theme="dark"] h4{color:#e8eaf0;}html[data-theme="dark"] .section p{color:#9aa5b8;}html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table th{background:#1a2535;color:#8a95a8;}html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td{border-color:#2a3548;color:#9aa5b8;}html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td:first-child{color:#e8eaf0;}html[data-theme="dark"] .dr-card{background:#080d16;}html[data-theme="dark"] .guide-footer{background:#141c2a;border-color:#2a3548;}html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-teal{background:#0e2f32;}html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-amber{background:#2a1f0a;}html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-green{background:#0e2a1c;}html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-red{background:#2a1515;}html[data-theme="dark"] .disclaimer{background:#2a1f0a;}html[data-view="desktop"]{min-width:1024px;}html[data-view="desktop"] body{min-width:1024px;}.guide-toggle-bar{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:6px 32px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.18);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.06);justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;}.lang-label{font-size:11px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.35);margin-right:4px;}.lang-btn{font-family:'DM Sans',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);background:transparent;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);cursor:pointer;transition:all .2s;}.lang-btn:hover{color:white;}.lang-btn.active{background:#b8962e;border-color:#b8962e;color:white;}[data-lang].lang-hidden{display:none!important;}.toggle-btn{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:11px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:16px;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;}.print-btn{position:fixed;bottom:80px;right:24px;width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--teal,#1a6b72);color:white;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .2s;z-index:9998;}.print-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.1);}.print-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;}.float-controls{position:fixed;bottom:24px;right:24px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;z-index:9999;}.float-btn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;border:none;cursor:pointer;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,.3);transition:transform .2s;background:#0f1e2e;color:white;}.float-btn:hover{transform:scale(1.1);}.float-btn.active{background:#b8962e;}.float-btn svg{width:18px;height:18px;}.float-btn .float-tooltip{position:absolute;right:54px;background:rgba(15,30,46,.92);color:white;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap;padding:5px 10px;border-radius:6px;pointer-events:none;opacity:0;transition:opacity .15s;}.float-btn:hover .float-tooltip{opacity:1;}

  /* ── CONTRAST IMPROVEMENTS (v2) ── */

  /* Light-background text — darker for readability */
  .section > .container > p,
  .section p:not(.hero-sub):not(.intro-callout p) { color: #2c3340; }
  .feature-card p { color: #2c3340; }
  .feature-card h4 { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .alert-body p, .alert-body ul, .alert-body ul li { color: #2c3340; }
  .alert-body h4 { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .lab-table td { color: #2c3340; }
  .lab-table td:first-child { color: #0f1e2e; font-weight: 600; }
  .step-body p { color: #2c3340; }
  .step-body h4 { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .disclaimer { color: #2c3340; }
  .illus-caption { color: #2c3340; font-size: 13px; font-style: italic; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.65; display: block; }
  .intro-callout .illus-caption { color: rgba(255,255,255,.82) !important; font-style: italic; }
  .guide-footer p { color: #4a5260; }

  /* Light cards */
  .herb-card { background: #ffffff; }
  .herb-card h4 { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .herb-card .h-aka { color: #4a5260; }
  .herb-card p { color: #2c3340; }
  .myth-card.busted, .myth-card.partial, .myth-card.caution, .myth-card.true { background: #ffffff; }
  .myth-claim { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .myth-explanation { color: #2c3340; }
  .myth-explanation strong { color: #0f1e2e; }
  .alt-card p { color: #1e3a2a; }
  .req-block ul li { color: #2c3340; }
  .z-benefit { color: #2c3340; }
  .z-benefit .zb-label { color: #0f1e2e; }

  /* illus-wrap — slightly off-white so SVG text pops */
  .illus-wrap { background: #f0f4f8; }

  /* DARK-BACKGROUND PANELS — always white text, no exceptions */
  .intro-callout { background: #0f1e2e; }
  .intro-callout p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.92) !important; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.75; margin: 0; }
  .intro-callout p strong { color: #ffffff !important; }
  .dr-card { background: #0f1e2e; }
  .dr-card h4 { color: #ffffff !important; }
  .dr-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88) !important; }
  .dr-card .dr-creds { color: rgba(255,255,255,.55) !important; }
  .checklist { background: #0f1e2e; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
  .checklist h4 { color: rgba(255,255,255,.95) !important; }
  .checklist ul li { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88) !important; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.1); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .checklist ul li::before { color: #d4af4f; }
  .appt-form-header h3 { color: #ffffff !important; }
  .appt-form-header p { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6) !important; }
  .hero-sub { color: rgba(255,255,255,.88) !important; }
  .hero-meta { color: rgba(255,255,255,.6) !important; }
  .hero-meta strong { color: rgba(255,255,255,.9) !important; }

  /* Dark mode — keep all text legible */
  html[data-theme="dark"] .section p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-body p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alert-body ul li,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .step-body p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .myth-explanation,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .lab-table td,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .disclaimer,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .req-block ul li,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .z-benefit,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .herb-card p,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .alt-card p{ color: #c0cad8 !important; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .feature-card h4,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .step-body h4,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .myth-claim,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .z-benefit .zb-label,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .req-block h4{ color: #e8eaf0 !important; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .illus-caption { color: #8a95a8; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .illus-wrap { background: #1a2535; }
  .illus-wrap-light { background: #f9fafb !important; border: 1px solid #e2e6eb; border-radius: 14px; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .illus-wrap-light { background: #f9fafb !important; }
  html[data-theme="dark"] .herb-card,
  html[data-theme="dark"] .myth-card{ background: #1a2535 !important; border-color: #2a3548; }

    /* ── TOGGLE BAR contrast fix ── */
  .guide-toggle-bar {
    background: rgba(10, 18, 32, 0.96) !important;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08) !important;
  }


  /* ── LANG TOGGLE (guide pages) ── */
  .guide-lang-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    padding: 0 32px; height: 36px;
    background: rgba(0,0,0,.35);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1);
    justify-content: flex-end;
  }
  .guide-lang-bar .lang-lbl { font-size: 10px; color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); letter-spacing:.06em; margin-right:2px; }
  .lang-btn-g {
    font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 500;
    padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);
    background: transparent; color: rgba(255,255,255,.6);
    cursor: pointer; transition: all .18s;
  }
  .lang-btn-g:hover { color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.4); }
  .lang-btn-g.active { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold); color: white; }
  [data-lang].lang-hidden { display: none !important; }

</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header">
  <a href="https://williamriveromd.com" class="brand">W. G. M. <strong>Rivero</strong>, MD</a>
  <a href="https://williamriveromd.com/guides/index.html" class="back">← All Guides</a>
</header>
<div class="guide-toggle-bar">
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
    <span class="lang-label">Language:</span>
    <button class="lang-btn active" id="glb-en" onclick="setLang('en')">English</button>
    <button class="lang-btn" id="glb-tl" onclick="setLang('tl')">Tagalog</button>
    <button class="lang-btn" id="glb-ceb" onclick="setLang('ceb')">Cebuano</button>
  </div>
  <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;">
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="darkToggle" onclick="toggleDark()"><svg id="darkIcon" width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg><span id="darkLabel">Dark</span></button>
    <button class="toggle-btn" id="desktopToggle" onclick="toggleDesktop()"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="3" width="20" height="14" rx="2"/><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"/></svg><span id="desktopLabel">Desktop</span></button>
  </div>
</div>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-tag">Cardiology · Nephrology · Rehabilitation</div>
    <h1>Cardiac Rehabilitation for CKD Patients After Acute MI</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">CKD patients who suffer a heart attack face unique challenges — higher mortality, contraindications to standard medications, and dialysis scheduling conflicts. This structured rehabilitation guide bridges cardiology and nephrology for safe, effective recovery.</p>
    <div class="hero-meta">
      <span><strong>Author:</strong> W. G. M. Rivero, MD, FPCP, DPSN</span>
      <span><strong>Updated:</strong> 2025</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
